// Ch8 B16, the boss intro (act1_ch08.md §5; W18, 18 mm, low, looking up). Letterboxed, 0.5 min. A limb
// of the Undertow itself, not a spawn: a column of black water and cloud as thick as a tower comes over
// the parapet from the sea side and splays into a "hand" of spawn-crust that grips the wall-head beside
// the hoist. Its wounds bleed spawn_wound cyan. We only ever see the forearm and hand. The chapter flow
// opens the battle (undertows_reach) when this scene ends. It can't be won: the party can only hold,
// see, and leave (ADR 0017 (c)).
title: ch08_the_reach
location: ch08/corrow
---
@letterbox on
@camera W18
@music undertow_reach fade=0.5
@sfx reach_rises
@wait 2.5
@sfx reach_grips
@anim toma shield_up
Toma [determined]: Hold. #line:ch08_the_reach_001
@letterbox off
===
